        "The _resetBuildInProgress() function is test-only infrastructure and should not be called in production code.",
        "All TypeScript types clean, no linting issues introduced in touched files."
      ]
    },
    {
      "from_agent": "QA",
      "to_agent": "Security Auditor",
      "timestamp": "2026-07-21T14:58:39Z",
      "notes": [
        "All 15 ACs verified and met. 36 integration tests pass, 3523 total tests clean.",
