        "No security concerns identified in this review — handler follows same ApiError/Zod validation pattern as api-repos.ts. Security Auditor should review UUID validation bypass potential and path traversal in modelRegistryDir()."
      ]
    },
    {
      "from_agent": "Security Auditor",
      "to_agent": "Reviewer",
      "timestamp": "2026-07-21T15:00:49Z",
      "notes": [
        "Security audit PASS. 0 Critical, 0 High findings. All 15 ACs confirmed met. One Medium noted: handleUpdateAssignments error message at api-models.ts ~line 339 leaks full persona ID list — low practical risk (localhost-bound, persona IDs are not secrets) but worth tightening in a follow-up. One Info: handleGetPersonas returns an unconstrained cast at ~line 507 — acceptable for current read-only display use; add Zod validation if the result ever feeds server-side logic. No blocking issues. Ready for code review."
      ]
    }
  ]
}

